# Contract needs a use case

An operation names a use case from `plugin-project-manager`. If none is accepted, ask for it. Do not invent the goal.

The authentication scheme matches a requirement `plugin-security` already wrote. If none exists, ask for it. Do not invent the control.

The aggregate and the adapter that fulfill the contract belong to `plugin-backend`. The reader-facing reference belongs to `plugin-documentation`. This plugin writes the contract.
